    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1087">

                <pb facs="1168" n="1072" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1072"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Newel to Mr. Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The
                                Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1898-02-21"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February 21, 1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 80.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to state that immediately
                    upon receipt of the news of the sad disaster to the cruiser <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Maine</hi> the minister of foreign affairs personally
                    called upon me to express the deep sympathy of his Government, and also that the
                    Spanish and German ministers to this court took an early opportunity of evincing
                    their deep regret and condolence with the American people.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stanford Newel.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
